Scope of this license

The MIT terms below apply only to Palermo Penano's original contributions
identified here. Notebook cell numbers are one-based positions at repository
commit fb0e17e8929f5801582edca780ac27940af7ca9e; they identify locations,
not a license for each complete cell.

Covered contributions:
- README.md: Palermo's project summaries.
- boston_housing/boston_housing.ipynb: student-written answer text in cells
  10, 18, 22, 27, 31, 33, 36, 38, 44, 47, 51; original implementation additions
  in cells 2, 8, 11, 14, 20, 40.
- customer_segments/customer_segments.ipynb: student-written answer text in
  cells 12, 16, 21, 30, 35, 47, 51, 58, 61, 65, 67, 71; original implementation
  additions in cells 5, 9, 10, 14, 20, 24, 28, 33, 39, 49, 53, 55, 56.
- finding_donors/finding_donors.ipynb: student-written answer and analysis
  text in cells 27, 32, 35, 37, 43, 46, 61, 65; original implementation
  additions in cells 4, 8, 18, 24, 29, 31, 39, 40, 47-55, 57-59.
- titanic_survival_exploration/titanic_survival_exploration.ipynb:
  student-written answer text in cells 13, 20, 27, 36, 38; original
  implementation additions in cells 2, 17, 24, 29, 30, 31, 33.
- naive_bayes_spam.ipynb: Palermo's original introduction in cell 1 and
  independently authored code additions in cells 2, 4, 5, 9, 11, 15, 23, 24.
- dog-project/dog_app.ipynb: Palermo's original diagnostic and path-configuration
  additions in cells 2, 5, 7, 13, 18, 22, 23, 26, 28.
- extras/student-admissiomns-keras/StudentAdmissionsKeras.ipynb:
  Palermo's diagnostic additions in cells 2, 4, 5, 18.

Only independently authored additions are covered. Inherited assignment text,
hints, scaffolding, code, comments, examples, and third-party passages within
these cells are excluded. The upstream sources are identified in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. A changed line does not by itself establish original
authorship or override rights in underlying material.

The same limited grant covers reproductions of the identified original
contributions in boston_housing/report.html,
customer_segments/customer_segments.html,
finding_donors/finding_donors.html, and
titanic_survival_exploration/titanic_survival_exploration.html.
It does not cover the complete HTML reports, their templates, embedded
third-party assets, or dataset-derived output.

All other content is outside this grant, including Udacity course material,
all datasets, images, model assets, visuals.py and compiled .pyc files,
project descriptions, subproject README files, copied tutorial material,
and third-party libraries or generated output.

IMPORTANT: Udacity machine-learning material has CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 terms.
This MIT grant covers only Palermo's own rights. It does not authorize
distribution of adaptations of that material or remove its NonCommercial
or NoDerivatives restrictions. Distribution permission for combined or adapted
coursework remains unresolved. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

